stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Trusted-network egress states
  accDescr: The gateway selects VLESS or direct access using LAN identity. Unavailable VLESS blocks ordinary external traffic outside trusted networks.
  direction TB
  [*] --> VPN: No match or detection error
  [*] --> Direct: Trusted LAN matches at gateway startup
  state "VLESS egress" as VPN
  state "Direct via Mac" as Direct
  state "External traffic blocked" as Blocked
  VPN --> Direct: Trusted LAN detected
  Direct --> VPN: No match / rule removed / detection error
  VPN --> Blocked: VLESS unavailable
  Blocked --> VPN: VLESS path restored
  Blocked --> Direct: Trusted LAN detected
  note right of Direct
    Match subnet + gateway IP + gateway MAC.
    Retain the same guarded VM interface.
    Home access survives VLESS failure.
  end note
  note left of VPN
    Check before new connections and about every second.
    Network / mode changes close old flows.
    Roaming detection is not atomic with OS routing.
  end note
